    "rich_text_xbFPbM": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_ynjcCq": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Why Cats Love Enclosed Hideouts</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_faVBT6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Cats are both hunters and prey by nature, which makes them instinctively drawn to enclosed spaces. A <strong>Cat Cave</strong> mimics the safe dens they’d find in the wild. Here’s why that matters:</p><ul><li><strong>Security and Privacy</strong> – Enclosed walls let cats feel safe when they nap.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Warmth</strong> – Felt material traps body heat, creating a snug environment.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Observation</strong> – Openings let cats peek out while still feeling hidden.<br/><br/></li></ul><p>I’ve seen this firsthand. A nervous rescue I once fostered would bolt under the bed whenever guests arrived. But when given a felt cat cave, she began using it instead—still hidden, but in a healthier, more accessible spot.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_ynjcCq",
        "text_faVBT6"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.rich-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "full_width": true,
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
    "rich_text_KaQxnw": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_rXpewP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>The Materials That Make It Special</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_zht9aM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Not all pet products are created equal, and one thing I appreciate about the Snarky Pets Cat Cave is the thought put into the materials.</p><ul><li><strong>Premium Felt:</strong> Thick, durable felt creates a structure that holds its shape while staying soft and cozy. Cats love the texture, and it resists odors better than synthetic fabrics.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Safe and Non-Toxic:</strong> No harsh chemicals or artificial dyes. That’s peace of mind for any owner.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Hand-Finished Details:</strong> Every cave has clean stitching, a smooth interior, and a quality finish that feels more like furniture than a basic pet bed.<br/><br/></li></ul><p>I’ve used a lot of cat furniture over the years, and cheaper options collapse or fray quickly. Felt caves like this one last longer and continue looking good even after months of daily use.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_rXpewP",
        "text_zht9aM"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.rich-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "full_width": true,
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
    "rich_text_7GJRRB": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Q6cWLY": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>A Cat Cave That Fits Your Home Too</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_faMV36": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Let’s be honest—pet furniture often clashes with home décor. But this Cat Cave is designed to blend in, not stick out. With its modern circular shape, minimalist design, and subtle color options, it looks like an intentional piece of home décor.</p><p>I keep one in my living room, and visitors often mistake it for a designer accent piece until my cat pops her head out. It’s refreshing to find a pet product that doesn’t compromise style for function.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Q6cWLY",
        "text_faMV36"
      ],
