    "rich_text_QNTdcA": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Q7drgC": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>The Health and Behavioral Benefits</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_Ff8GJk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A Cat Cave<strong> </strong>doesn’t just look good—it actively improves your cat’s daily life.</p><ul><li><strong>Reduces Stress:</strong> Cats who have a retreat handle household noise, visitors, and other pets better.</li><li><strong>Promotes Better Sleep:</strong> Deeper, undisturbed rest supports overall health and mood.<br/></li><li><strong>Supports Instincts:</strong> Satisfies their need to hide, stalk, and observe safely.</li><li><strong>Keeps Fur Contained:</strong> Many cats choose the cave over furniture, which means less hair on your couch or bed.<br/><br/></li></ul><p>I’ve noticed anxious cats become calmer once they have a cave. It’s like giving them their own “room” in the house.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Q7drgC",
        "text_Ff8GJk"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.rich-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "full_width": true,
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
    "rich_text_NDnFqk": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_eRWtEd": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>How to Choose and Place Your Cat Cave</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_RJMc7P": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Even the best product needs the right setup. A few tips from my experience:</p><ul><li><strong>Placement Matters:</strong> Put it in a quiet corner or near a sunny window—cats love warmth and privacy.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Introduce Gradually:</strong> If your cat ignores it at first, add a toy, blanket, or sprinkle of catnip inside.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>One Per Cat:</strong> In multi-cat homes, give each cat their own cave to avoid turf wars.<br/><br/></li></ul><p>When I first brought one home, I placed it too close to a busy walkway. My cat ignored it for days. Moving it near the window instantly made it her favorite nap spot.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_eRWtEd",
        "text_RJMc7P"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.rich-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "full_width": true,
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
    "rich_text_TNwNti": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_MJqPMr": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Care and Maintenance Tips</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_TtWFJA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A Cat Cave is built to last, but a little care keeps it fresh:</p><ul><li><strong>Vacuum Weekly</strong> – Removes fur and dander.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Spot Clean with Mild Soap</strong> – Gently dab stains; no harsh scrubbing needed.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Air Dry Naturally</strong> – Avoid dryers or heaters that could warp the felt.<br/><br/></li></ul><p>One trick I share with clients: rotate the cave occasionally to keep it “new” in your cat’s eyes. Cats love exploring things that seem different, even if it’s just a small change in angle or location.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_MJqPMr",
        "text_TtWFJA"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.rich-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "color_scheme": "",
