    "rich_text_Yd6ndw": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_KVGQa4": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Conclusion: Why Your Cat Needs a Cave</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_wCtFxr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>After ten years of observing feline behavior, I can say this with confidence: every cat benefits from having a private, enclosed retreat. The Snarky Pets Cat Cave provides that safe hideout while also serving as an attractive piece of home décor.</p><p>It’s durable, easy to clean, comfortable for cats, and stylish for owners. If you’ve been looking for a way to make your cat happier while keeping your home tidy and modern, this is it.</p><p>Give your cat the gift of comfort and security—it’s an investment that pays off every single day in purrs, naps, and fewer fur-covered couches.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_KVGQa4",
        "text_wCtFxr"
      ],
