    "rich_text_wVWxnC": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_xVMrXT": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>FAQs </strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_G6zn6q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>1. Is the Snarky Pets Cat Cave suitable for large cats?</strong><br/> It comfortably fits cats up to 12 lbs. For very large breeds like Maine Coons, you may need a bigger option.</p><p><br/><strong>2. How do I get my cat to use the cave?</strong><br/>Place it in a quiet spot and add familiar scents—like a favorite blanket—or a sprinkle of catnip. Most cats warm up quickly.<br/><br/><strong>3.Can it be used for kittens as well?</strong><br/>Yes! Kittens often love cat caves because they feel extra safe inside. Just make sure the entrance is accessible and the cave is placed in a safe spot.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
